        "rewards_formatted": "冒险阅历 x200, 原石 x30, 摩拉 x20000, 大英雄的经验 x2, 食谱：马萨拉芝士球 x1",
        "chapter": {
            "icon": "UI_ChapterIcon_Common",
            "id": "10069",
            "num": "",
            "title": "愿为一炊之梦"
        },
        "total_dialogue_lines": 141,
        "total_speaker_counts": {
            "Black Screen": 6,
            "Player": 31,
            "兰阿帕斯": 53,
            "写有缭乱字迹的叶子": 5,
